---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Handheld GameDB" description="Learn about Handheld GameDB — the community-driven handheld gaming performance database built by gamers, for gamers.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <article class="prose prose-invert max-w-none">

      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white">About Handheld GameDB</h1>

      <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
        Handheld GameDB is a community-driven handheld gaming performance database. Our mission is to help gamers find the optimal settings for every game on every handheld device. Built by gamers, for gamers.
      </p>

      <!-- What is HandheldDB -->
      <section class="mt-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">What is HandheldDB?</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          HandheldDB is the go-to resource for handheld PC gaming performance data. Whether you own a Steam Deck, ROG Ally, Legion Go, or any other handheld gaming PC, our database gives you real-world performance benchmarks, optimal settings profiles, and battery life estimates submitted by actual players.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          No more guessing which settings to use. No more watching 20-minute YouTube videos just to find out if a game runs on your device. Search, find the best settings, and start playing.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- How It Works -->
      <section class="mt-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">How It Works</h2>

        <div class="mt-6 space-y-6">
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#292524] bg-gray-900/50 p-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#D4A574]">1. Submit Reports</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-gray-300">
              Players submit performance reports for games they have tested on their handheld devices. Each report includes the device used, graphics settings, average FPS, TDP configuration, and battery life observations. The more detail, the more helpful the report.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#292524] bg-gray-900/50 p-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#D4A574]">2. Community Voting</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-gray-300">
              Other players vote on reports based on accuracy. Did those settings actually deliver the reported FPS? Was battery life as described? Votes help surface the most reliable data and push down inaccurate or outdated reports.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#292524] bg-gray-900/50 p-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#D4A574]">3. Consensus Algorithm</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-gray-300">
              Our consensus algorithm aggregates multiple reports for the same game-device combination, weighting them by vote count, recency, and reporter reputation. The result is three optimized settings profiles per game: Battery Saver, Balanced, and Performance -- each with expected FPS, thermals, and battery life.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Supported Devices -->
      <section class="mt-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Supported Devices</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          HandheldDB supports all major handheld gaming PCs, including:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-gray-300">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#D4A574] flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong class="text-white">Valve</strong> -- Steam Deck LCD, Steam Deck OLED</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#D4A574] flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong class="text-white">ASUS</strong> -- ROG Ally, ROG Ally X</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#D4A574] flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong class="text-white">Lenovo</strong> -- Legion Go, Legion Go S</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#D4A574] flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong class="text-white">MSI</strong> -- Claw, Claw 8 AI+</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#D4A574] flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong class="text-white">Ayaneo</strong>, <strong class="text-white">GPD</strong>, <strong class="text-white">ONEXPLAYER</strong>, and more</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-400">
          Don't see your device? <a href="/report/new" class="text-[#D4A574] hover:text-[#E8C5A0] underline">Submit a report</a> and we will add it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Open Source -->
      <section class="mt-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Open Source</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          HandheldDB believes in transparency and community ownership. Our performance data is freely accessible, and submitted reports are licensed under <strong class="text-white">CC-BY</strong>, meaning anyone can use, share, and build upon them with attribution.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          We are committed to keeping this database open and community-driven. The gaming community creates the data, the gaming community benefits from it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Contact -->
      <section class="mt-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Have questions, feedback, or want to contribute? We would love to hear from you.
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-gray-300">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-[#D4A574] flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.75 6.75v10.5a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25h-15a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25-2.25V6.75m19.5 0A2.25 2.25 0 0019.5 4.5h-15a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25m19.5 0v.243a2.25 2.25 0 01-1.07 1.916l-7.5 4.615a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.36 0L3.32 8.91a2.25 2.25 0 01-1.07-1.916V6.75" />
            </svg>
            <span>Email: <a href="mailto:hello@handheldgamedb.com" class="text-[#D4A574] hover:text-[#E8C5A0] underline">hello@handheldgamedb.com</a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-[#D4A574] flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.31 3.435 9.795 8.205 11.385.6.105.825-.255.825-.57 0-.285-.015-1.23-.015-2.235-3.015.555-3.795-.735-4.035-1.41-.135-.345-.72-1.41-1.23-1.695-.42-.225-1.02-.78-.015-.795.945-.015 1.62.87 1.845 1.23 1.08 1.815 2.805 1.305 3.495.99.105-.78.42-1.305.765-1.605-2.67-.3-5.46-1.335-5.46-5.925 0-1.305.465-2.385 1.23-3.225-.12-.3-.54-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 1.005-.315 3.3 1.23.96-.27 1.98-.405 3-.405s2.04.135 3 .405c2.295-1.56 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.765.84 1.23 1.905 1.23 3.225 0 4.605-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.925.435.375.81 1.095.81 2.22 0 1.605-.015 2.895-.015 3.3 0 .315.225.69.825.57A12.02 12.02 0 0024 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12z" />
            </svg>
            <span>GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/handheldgamedb" class="text-[#D4A574] hover:text-[#E8C5A0] underline">handheldgamedb</a></span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
